  "question": {
    "text": "A monochromatic plane wave of speed c and wavelength <math> <mrow> <mi>λ</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is diffracted at a small aperture. The diagram illustrates successive wavefronts (vibrating in the same phase). After what time will some portion of the wavefront <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>XY</mi></math> reach <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0030074_qUESTION.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 117px; height: 148px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
